{"study_accession":"PRJNA713319","secondary_study_accession":"SRP310116","title":"Transcriptome analysis of blood Vγ9 Vδ2 gdT cells upon TCR and Notch signalling","description":"We utilized RNA-seq to identify differential gene expression in Vγ9 Vδ2 gdT cells isolated from human PBMCs upon TCR stimulation. We find that ~30% genes are commonly up- and down-regulated between different phosphoantigen treatments (p<0.05). Inhibition of Notch signaling alongside TCR activation results in downregulation of many effector genes in Vγ9 Vδ2 T cells. Overall design: PBMCs from healthy donors were subjected to MACS based gdT cell isolation. The isolated cells (~1 million each) were either untreated, treated with rIL2 only, or a combination of rIL2+IPP, rIL2+HDMAPP and rIL2+anti-CD3 for T cell activation. Notch signaling inhibitor treatment was done using GSI-X along with TCR activation. Three replicates were sequenced for all the 8 treatment samples.","pubmed":"34526984","geo_series":"","n_samples":23,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN18242668","study_accession":"PRJNA713319","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"gdT_IL2_HDMAPP_rep3","description":"gdT_IL2_HDMAPP_rep3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5151995","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-08-28","attributes":[["source_name","Blood"],["treatment","hIL2 + HDMAPP"],["cell_type","PBMCs"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13926271","experiment_accession":"SRX10305724","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":16499040,"base_count":4982710080,"first_public":"2021-08-28","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM5151995: gdT_IL2_HDMAPP_rep3 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN18242669","study_accession":"PRJNA713319","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"gdT_IL2_rep3","description":"gdT_IL2_rep3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5151994","access":"op